  "description": "Ji-woon, a freshman college student with a bright personality who believes in everything, starts a part-time job at a suspicious cafe without any doubt. Ji-woon, who went to quit his part-time job due to pressure from his friends to quit immediately, witnesses the bosses with big wings on their backs, and learns that the bosses are angels. Therefore\n\nAngels are Jiwoon\n\nTrying to erase the memory...\n\nOh, far from erasing memories, I suddenly see strange rings on people's hands...?!\n\nWhat Jiwoon saw was the 'Ring of Destiny! But the angels deliver the shocking news that Ji-woon doesn't have a ring...?\n\nwhy? I heard that all humans have it!\n\n\"Then... am I dying?!\" Will Ji-woon be able to safely overcome his fate?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/59427181), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%9A%B4%EB%AA%85%EC%9D%B8%EA%B0%80%EC%9A%94/3439)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/127810), [French](https://www.lezhinfr.com/detail/daf_1000682)",
